{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a clean, modern add-ons section for an event venue page called 241 Event Space. Match the existing Thread website style. Keep it minimal, polished, easy to scan, and mobile-friendly.
    
    Section title:
    Optional Add-Ons
    
    Intro text:
    Customize your event with optional rentals and support services.
    
    Use simple cards or grouped list items for these add-ons:
    
    Personalized Marquee — $25
    Black Metal Sign Stand — $25
    Couch — $50 each
    Bar Cart — $50
    Bar Cart with Soda Service — $400
    Decor Package — $25
    Personal Decorator — $50
    Set Up & Take Down of Tables & Chairs — $50
    On Site Coordinator — $50
    
    Keep descriptions short or omit them if needed. Focus on a clean layout and clear pricing., Create a clean, modern add-ons section for an event venue page called 241 Event Space. Match the existing Thread website style. Keep it minimal, polished, easy to scan, and mobile-friendly.
    
    Section title:
    Optional Add-Ons
    
    Intro text:
    Customize your event with optional rentals and support services.
    
    Use simple cards or grouped list items for these add-ons:
    
    Personalized Marquee — $25
    Black Metal Sign Stand — $25
    Couch — $50 each
